          "from": "Middle English half",
          "to": "half /hɑːf/",
          "note": "/l/ was lost before /f/ after a back vowel in Early Modern English; the spelling keeps ⟨l⟩."
        },
        {
          "from": "Middle English folk",
          "to": "folk /fəʊk/",
          "note": "/l/ was lost before /k/; a spelling pronunciation /foʊlk/ also occurs in General American."
